l","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8622&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=489120&INSPECTION_NN=489120","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"475481","date":"2023-09-27","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8622&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=475481&INSPECTION_NN=475481","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and clean","repeat":false,"comment":"Observed wet mop head stored head down in mop bucket. Store wet mop heads in inverted fashion to promote drying. \n\n6-501.16: After use, mops shall be placed in a position that allows them to airdry without soiling walls, EQUIPMENT, or supplies.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"444766","date":"2023-01-31","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8622&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=444766&INSPECTION_NN=444766","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"434351","date":"2022-10-12","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8622&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=434351&INSPECTION_NN=434351","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"407820","date":"2022-01-28","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8622&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=407820&INSPECTION_NN=407820","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"407173","date":"2022-01-19","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":2,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8622&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=407173&INSPECTION_NN=407173","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":51,"title":"Plumbing installed; proper backflow devices","repeat":false,"comment":"Observed that the cold water faucet had hot water flowing from it at all sinks in the kitchen. This occurred when we were running the dish machine. Apparently this has happened on more than one occasion in the ten years this school has been in operation. I am concerned that this could be a back flow issue. I am not a plumber and therefore did not write it up as a plumbing violation. District OAM has been notified along with Cheryl McBride. The issue will be repaired as soon as possible.  District OAM is on site (a plumber with 25 yrs experience) He believes a cross connection is the issue and is working to correct the situation. \n5-205.15: A PLUMBING SYSTEM shall be: (A) Repaired according to LAW; P and (B) Maintained in good repair.","citation":"","citation_text":""},{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and clean","repeat":false,"comment":"Observed an area of caulk at the try return and garbage disposal/spray area to be soiled with mold. The silicone seal is not longer smooth and easily cleanable. Remove silicone seal, clean wall and replace seal. 6-201.16: (A) Wall and ceiling covering materials shall be attached so that they are EASILY CLEANABLE. (B) Except in areas used only for dry storage, concrete, porous blocks, or bricks used for indoor wall construction shall be finished and SEALED to provide a SMOOTH, nonabsorbent, EASILY CLEANABLE surface.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"396309","date":"2021-09-15","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","